{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And it shall be to you for a sign.</b> The Exodus from Egypt shall be to you <b>for a sign</b>." "<b>On your hand and for a remembrance between your eyes.</b> That you write these passages and bind them on the head and on the arm." "<b>On your hand.</b> On the left hand — therefore 'your hand' is filled with the second passage, to interpret in it 'hand' that is weak (Menachot 36)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:55.452193091Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}